OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fshowers will continue through the
OL,7,Fevening, these heavy and thundery in
OL,8,Fplaces. These showers will slowly ease
OL,9,Fovernight but the odd one will linger
OL,10,Funtil dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FA mainly dry and bright
OL,13,Fmorning with just isolated showers.
OL,14,FThe showers developing more widely for
OL,15,Fa time in the afternoon, heavy in
OL,16,Fplaces, then dying out. Feeling warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
